":396470,"title":"","content":"Should it? You guys have been putting up a hell of fight, and you might win.<br /> <br /> We're allowed to pimp points we find awesome.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Besides, we're not anywhere near the goal mark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T11:02:25-08:00","id":396518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396470#post396470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Should it? You guys have been putting up a hell of fight, and you might win.<br /> <br /> We're allowed to pimp points we find awesome.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Besides, we're not anywhere near the goal mark.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd pimp it on RPG.net if you really want Demon to win. I'm now torn on pretty much everything (except for the now defeated Blitz Innocents), since I note that the gamelines of winning setting haven't reappeared in the polls yet. Losing leads to exciting new options!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T12:05:43-08:00","id":396570,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396458#post396458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You can bold it, increase the font size and say it over and over if you want. It's not much of a concern for fans of Werewolf.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b><i><u>And then there's Dracula.And then there's Dracula.And then there's Dracula.And then there's Dracula.And then there's Dracula.And then there's Dracula.</u></i></b></span></span><br /> <br /> At least we can try to draw a few Vampire fans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T13:26:57-08:00","id":396719,"title":"","content":"Unless I miss my guess, he is not yet a leech.<br /> <br /> Which means we may get some ideas info about his sire, who/whatever that may be. Unless it really is God.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T14:05:39-08:00","id":396761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sakii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396570#post396570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(...) <b><i><u>And then there's Dracula.</u></i></b><br /> <br /> At least we can try to draw a few Vampire fans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which will turn out to be: A) A mysterious Dracula from <b>Ordo Dracul </b>book, on what we would not have really info in chapter beside what we got earlier, B) Working agent of God Machine that is using the Vlad Tepes body.<br /> <br /> Both of witch would not be anything near the description of Bram's Stoker original, or even full NPC for using in games - what is the only thing we need, as <b>Ordo Dracu</b>l's book is considered - rest was shown to us before, in books of gameline. ( And yes, I'm Ordo's fan in Vampire games ).<br /> <br /> I still thinks that &quot;<i>Forsaken by Rome</i>&quot; is more interesting Era - we have still working Rome, but players play a civilized &quot;barbarians&quot; left by the Empire to work the mess of clashing cultures of homeland and &quot;civilization&quot; they were introduced - opposing both Rome and other, real barbarians. It is great metaphor for the werewolves society at large, and highly marking themes of both savage fury and the hunt of the game. We probably see how Tribes are developing in Europe, what would nicely add to the historical depth of the <b>Werewolf</b> in general. And we have all the pagan gods to look over for our Packs, still making mess across continent. Not to mentioned obvious crossovers with <b>Requiem for Rome</b>. I will not exaggerated if I say that this era can be <b>Werewolf</b> equivalent of <i>To The Strongest</i> <b>Mage</b> one - and that setting is absolutely brilliant!<br /> <br /> Missing this all for only seeing Dracula not fully stated ( as he cannot be in nWoD paradigm of setting writing ) and courtly intrigues with half mechanical angels in Constantinople is just big disappointment. / For the remark, I think Constantinople is interesting setting, but so the Book of Judges to Hunter. They are not just brilliant and fresh in terms of they games, /","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-07-2015, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T14:14:58-08:00","id":396772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396761#post396761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Whitch will turn out to be: A) A mysterious Dracula from <b>Ordo Dracul </b>book, on what we would not have really info in chapter besdie what we got earlier, B) Working agent of God Machine that is using the Vlad Tepes body.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's at least one option C.<br /> <br /> I'm jazzed for all three of these settings, so please do trust me that we're going to put our all into whichever one you folks pick. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T14:35:29-08:00","id":396787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396761#post396761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which will turn out to be: A) A mysterious Dracula from <b>Ordo Dracul </b>book, on what we would not have really info in chapter beside what we got earlier, B) Working agent of God Machine that is using the Vlad Tepes body.<br /> <br /> Both of witch would not be anything near the description of Bram's Stoker original, or even full NPC for using in games - what is the only thing we need, as <b>Ordo Dracu</b>l's book is considered - rest was shown to us before, in books of gameline. ( And yes, I'm Ordo's fan in Vampire games ).<br /> ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Bram Stoker is easy, get a copy of Dracula and read it and then make it something that happened in the setting. Historical Dracula, however, and one who will be the eventual founder of the Vampire Covenant Ordo Dracul, while he's still causing trouble for the Ottoman Empire? That sounds pretty important, even if it turns out to be half a page or a sidebar and with the previous kickstarter win of Sidebars about other Splats? It'd be pretty awesome to see a sidebar about Vampires in the Ottoman Empire, don't you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T14:50:08-08:00","id":396799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DesolateDolly</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396787#post396787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bram Stoker is easy, get a copy of Dracula and read it and then make it something that happened in the setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>On that note, I'm really looking forward to <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1721105501/the-dracula-dossier\" target=\"_blank\"><i>The Dracula Dossier</i></a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T19:43:09-08:00","id":397084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=396761#post396761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I still thinks that &quot;<i>Forsaken by Rome</i>&quot; is more interesting Era - we have still working Rome, but players play a civilized &quot;barbarians&quot; left by the Empire to work the mess of clashing cultures of homeland and &quot;civilization&quot; they were introduced - opposing both Rome and other, real barbarians. It is great metaphor for the werewolves society at large, and highly marking themes of both savage fury and the hunt of the game. We probably see how Tribes are developing in Europe, what would nicely add to the historical depth of the <b>Werewolf</b> in general. And <b>we have all the pagan gods to look over for our Packs</b>, still making mess across continent. Not to mentioned obvious crossovers with <b>Requiem for Rome</b>. I will not exaggerated if I say that this era can be <b>Werewolf</b> equivalent of <i>To The Strongest</i> <b>Mage</b> one - and that setting is absolutely brilliant!</div> </div> </div> </div>Lost me at the Pagan Gods bit. How's that work?<br /> <br /> Isn't Spirits as mythological gods also pretty low hanging fruit?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T22:39:51-08:00","id":397216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=395798#post395798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cripes, why are people voting for Forsaken By Rome again?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I honestly have no idea - except for the desire for an Uratha setting (which I get! I want more Uratha as well). The fact that it's not between Ottoman Demon and Biblical Hunter confounds me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T22:43:02-08:00","id":397217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=395530#post395530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unless Matt changed it, it's an alternate setting. Not one that's exactly Judeo-Christian, but it's an age of myth that might or might not lead to the present day.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ok, so then this setting (the Ottoman one) is our chance to see the Pre-Industrial God Machine &amp; its Unchained?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T23:50:34-08:00","id":397247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=397217#post397217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, so then this setting (the Ottoman one) is our chance to see the Pre-Industrial God Machine &amp; its Unchained?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was trying to clarify whether the STG setting was historical or not. My plan was that it would be pre-industrial, and I think Matt went ahead with that. (Though I could also see us doing a fabulous <i>Reign: The Conqueror</i> kind of thing. Maybe another time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> The main change that happens as you go backwards in time is that Infrastructure gets harder to construct. The God-Machine still creates things of intricate and monstrous mechanical sophistication. But since it's building with what it has available, it can't build as much, and some of the instruments are by necessity cruder. The Machine has not followed the march of human technology. Rather, we have marched right towards <i>it</i>.<br /> <br /> There'll be some interesting revelations if we do this chapter. My working title for it is After the Fall, and we're going to see what happens when the systems that run a society are smashed and replaced. Remember that Infrastructure can be processes and the movement of people just as much as factories and thinking machines. So here we'll see things in disarray. Given the chance, can the Unchained come together to build a better world? What if humans simply removed malfunctioning components so that the former Constantinople can be upgraded?<br /> <br /> We've talked about the Unchained of Istanbul in a modern context, and you'll see links to that in After the Fall, but this is a freestanding setting rather than a prequel. I also have a link in mind to <i>Fall of the Camarilla</i>, which we'll see about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T03:13:15-08:00","id":397330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">We've talked about the Unchained of Istanbul in a modern context, and you'll see links to that in After the Fall, but this is a freestanding setting rather than a prequel. I also have a link in mind to <i>Fall of the Camarilla</i>, which we'll see about.</div> </div> </div> </div>Must. Get. It. Now. So awesome.<br /> <br /> And as for the G-M, it is still the same. It's the Demons who wouldn't understand the tech, like no Unchained understands how to construct Occult Matrix Infrastructure. Except for that one in Berlin","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T10:04:28-08:00","id":397731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=397330#post397330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Must. Get. It. Now. So awesome.<br /> <br /> And as for the G-M, it is still the same. It's the Demons who wouldn't understand the tech, like no Unchained understands how to construct Occult Matrix Infrastructure. Except for that one in Berlin</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The underlying scientific principles that the God-Machine exploits to fabricate an occult matrix are as much a closed book to demons as to the world\u2019s other inhabitants, but they have just enough knowledge of the Infrastructure that called them forth as angels and hid them from mortals to maintain their Cover after their fall. Still, some of the Unchained collect intelligence on known occult matrices in hopes of one day harnessing the power to construct new Infrastructure. <b>So far, all known attempts to do so have either ended in failure or culminated in annihilation by the God-Machine\u2019s servants.</b> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">characterlimit</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T12:12:11-08:00","id":397881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=397084#post397084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lost me at the Pagan Gods bit. How's that work?<br /> <br /> Isn't Spirits as mythological gods also pretty low hanging fruit?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is not as clear cut as you would like to think - we have one <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/135690-spirits-and-gods\">developed topic on forum solely for this kind representation</a>. With spirits, you must remember they are predatory, animalistic beings that have also they own, sentient personality. With that in mind, spirits are quite as gods of human mythologies, but also quite contrary to them.<br /> <br /> In this, local Celts that worship <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Morr%C3%ADgan\" target=\"_blank\">Morrigan</a> probably are giving Essence for some War spirit(s) - that in the end, could become Royal Avatar of even greater being, but also still being it's own &quot;variant&quot; of this elemental force of death. Probably in female-ish silhouette figure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-08-2015, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-08T18:57:30-08:00","id":398294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/395383-dark-era-demon-poll?p=395753#post395753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And then there's Dracula.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is Vlad still an Ottoman hostage in 1453? I know he takes the Wallachia throne in 1456, but my sources are vague on exactly when his captivity ended.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T11:43:28-08:00","id":400589,"title":"","content":"Come on guys let Forsaken win this one. Your Dark Era already has twice the page count (based off the image). With W:tF 2.0 coming soon you all know your gonna want more settings! Please? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1824,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","user":"Xaielao","date":". 02-10-2015, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","name":"Xaielao","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T14:55:00-08:00","id":400873,"